  "name": {
    "@value": "An Atlas of Immune Cell Exhaustion in HIV-Infected Individuals Revealed by Single-Cell Transcriptomics."
  },
  "description": {
    "@value": "The effects of HIV infection on immune cell exhaustion at the transcriptomic level was investigated by analyzing single-cell RNA sequencing of peripheral blood mononuclear cells from four healthy subjects (37,847 cells) and six HIV-infected donors (28,610 cells)."
  },
